# NotebookLM notebook index

Copy this file to `notebooks.md` for a local routing cache:

```sh
cp references/notebooks.md.example references/notebooks.md
```

The local file may contain personal NotebookLM titles and IDs. Keep it
untracked; `references/notebooks.md` is ignored by Git.

Snapshot taken YYYY-MM-DD from `notebooklm_list_notebooks`, profile `PROFILE`.
The live account returned N notebooks. Titles below are trimmed for display;
the ID is the value to pass as `notebook_id`.

| Alias | Notebook | ID | Sources | Updated | Use for |
|---|---|---|---:|---|---|
| example | Example notebook | `example-notebook-id` | 0 | YYYY-MM-DD | example topic |

When the index is missing, stale, or ambiguous, call
`notebooklm_list_notebooks` before querying and do not guess an ID.
